'''Royal Association Athlétique Louviéroise La Louvière''' (known by its abbreviation '''RAAL La Louvière''') is a [[football in Belgium|Belgian]] professional [[association football|football]] club based in [[La Louvière]], in the province of [[Hainaut (province)|Hainaut]]. The club was founded in 2009. It competes in the [[Belgian Pro League]], the top tier of [[Belgian football league system|Belgian football]], after being promoted from the [[Challenger Pro League]] in 2025."}}
